  "body": "Discover a superb collection of five brand-new, two-level modern homes at 64 County Road, Torbay, offering contemporary living, quality design and an enviable North Shore location.\r\n\r\nPositioned within popular school zones including Long Bay College, Torbay School and Northcross Intermediate, these homes are ideally suited to families seeking convenience, lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n\r\nEach home is thoughtfully designed across two levels. The ground floor features a single internal-access garage, guest toilet and a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. Large glass sliding doors connect seamlessly to a private deck, creating an inviting space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, Lots 1 and 5 offer four bedrooms and two bathrooms, while Lots 2 to Lot 4 provide three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a practical study nook. Each home includes a master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while selected homes feature an elevated deck accessible from the master bedroom and hallway, adding another dimension to the indoor-outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing. Enjoy easy access to Long Bay Regional Park and Waiake Beach, with beautiful coastal scenery, beaches, walking tracks and recreational opportunities close by. Torbay's local amenities, schools and everyday conveniences are also within easy reach, while the wider North Shore and Auckland are readily accessible.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a modern family home, a low-maintenance lifestyle or a quality new-build in one of Auckland's sought-after coastal suburbs, these homes deserve your attention.",
